- «Fixed if it does»: the options (a settle wait after a resize, a read-back and one re-type, a refusal) priced before
  any start, each with the rows it moves; the choice made only AFTER the reading. (verified: priced in the P3 block;
  a fix can cover the driver's paste only — the architecture forbids holding a human key behind a resize)

- **Rows (`{doc} · {sheet}/{key}`):**
  - security-plan · decision/live-round-rig-keys-own-pty, decision/live-rig-hb-arm-keeps-attributes-only,
    decision/live-session-screens-kept-local, decision/live-rig-isolated-child, decision/live-rig-credentials-copy,
    decision/live-rig-seed-from-bundle-logic;
  - test-plan · decision/key-after-resize-waits-for-size, decision/no-child-screen-assertions,
    decision/standing-live-rig, decision/live-failing-reading-not-verification,
    decision/rig-no-key-read-from-keys-word;
  - a11y-plan · decision/no-screen-content-parsing, decision/human-keystrokes-never-blocked;
  - architecture · decision/human-key-never-held-behind-resize, decision/no-key-held-behind-resize,
    decision/no-probe-for-unrelied-shapes, decision/unconfirmed-delivery-not-delivered;
  - obs-plan · decision/claude-internals-not-a-contract.

