**The remove-the-guard controls** (validation check 4 (6); implement's one-shot `gate.py control`, never an entry;
ids of 1–16 characters, each on a filtered entry, `inputs#I6` item 7). Both fire entry 3 (the rig library cases,
filtered `test(/^rig::/)`, `--no-fail-fast`), `--timeout 1200`, a `timeout` reading NOT read as held:

- (tests) The five `KR` rehearsals pass over the fake agent — entry `bash scripts/agent-run.sh run --integration
  --filter 'test(/rig_rehearsal_kr/)'`:
  - the whole one reads `keys: x 13, del 13`, `kr-reading: kept`, `late-redraw: 0` and both sizes on the fake's
    `size` receipts;
  - the late one reads `late-redraw: 1`, `dirty-box: none`, `kr-reading: kept`, exit 0;
  - the withheld one reads `dirty-box: 3`, `late-redraw: 0`, `kr-reading: unverified`, exit 1;
  - a live start or another arm carrying a seam is refused `usage`, exit 2, nothing ledgered;
  - the one without `resize` types nothing.

- **The carries:** `cry-7mgt7ybs` and `cry-m267ghbx` re-pin whole (no `viola-pty` step); `cry-lqe3bfwx` retires as met
  in `1b22388f` (`src/bin/viola-fake-agent/input.rs:74-85`, held by `rig_rehearsal_reads_the_box_empty_after_x_and_del`);
  `cry-teayoana` is the Epoch 4 boundary's.

- **Coverage of new surfaces:**
  - `viola-live-rig rehearse kr --quiet-ms / --kr-del-seam` (test-only option surface) → validation {`quiet_of`
    100–400 and `KrSeam::parse` closed forms, `kr` arm alone, else `refused: usage` exit 2 ✓} · instrumentation {n/a —
    test-only rig, summary keys only} · PII {n/a — integers and closed words} · tests {unit ✓ · integ ✓} · a11y {n/a}
    · tokens {n/a}
  - the `KR` live arm (`viola-live-rig live KR|KR8|KR8-2`) → validation {grant `box,resize` required, else `refused:
    grant`; a modal or wrong first screen `refused: shape`; `ledger::admit` under `--cap`/`--spare`; refused under
    `CI` ✓} · instrumentation {n/a — test-only; ledger lines of closed words, counts and settle times} · PII {the kept
    frames 0600 under the gitignored `target/live-rig/`, never read into the evidence, a message or the tree ✓} · tests
    {integ ✓ (five KR rehearsals) · e2e live ✓ (`KR`, `KR8-2`)} · a11y {n/a} · tokens {n/a}

